{"t": 1793709412.853308, "s": 0.07, "code": "import numpy as np\nd=np.load(\"blocks.npz\")\n# top hidden input patterns\nfor (layer,hid) in [(0,1140),(0,461),(1,225),(1,1053),(2,823),(3,613),(3,1473)]:\n    Wfc=d[f\"W_fc.{layer}\"]\n    row=Wfc[hid]\n    idx=np.argsort(np.abs(row))[-15:][::-1]\n    print(f\"L{layer} hid{hid} norm={np.linalg.norm(row):.2f} top_in_dims {idx.tolist()} vals {[f'{row[j]:+.3f}' for j in idx]}\")\n# W_q.0 structure - which rows/cols big?\nWq0=d[\"W_q.0\"]\nmask=np.abs(Wq0)>0.5\nrc=mask.sum(axis=1); cc=mask.sum(axis=0)\nprint(\"Wq0 rows>5\", np.where(rc>5)[0][:20].tolist(), \"counts\", rc[rc>5][:20].tolist())\nprint(\"Wq0 cols>5\", np.where(cc>5)[0][:20].tolist(), \"counts\", cc[cc>5][:20].tolist())\n# sample row 164 (max)\nr164=Wq0[164]\nidx=np.argsort(np.abs(r164))[-10:][::-1]\nprint(\"Wq0 row164 top\", idx.tolist(), [f\"{r164[j]:+.3f}\" for j in idx])\n# Wk0 row144?\nWk0=d[\"W_k.0\"]\nr144=Wk0[144]\nidx=np.argsort(np.abs(r144))[-10:][::-1]\nprint(\"Wk0 row144 top\", idx.tolist(), [f\"{r144[j]:+.3f}\" for j in idx])\n", "out": "L0 hid1140 norm=4.42 top_in_dims [328, 298, 255, 383, 357, 248, 338, 367, 339, 43, 168, 237, 164, 261, 244] vals ['+0.829', '-0.737', '-0.680', '-0.597', '-0.587', '+0.571', '-0.559', '+0.517', '+0.511', '-0.506', '-0.495', '-0.490', '+0.474', '-0.470', '-0.468']\nL0 hid461 norm=4.26 top_in_dims [292, 361, 296, 359, 123, 305, 312, 63, 338, 53, 210, 91, 221, 328, 85] vals ['+0.858', '-0.592', '+0.588', '+0.565', '-0.562', '+0.558', '-0.548', '-0.528', '-0.519', '-0.497', '-0.482', '+0.468', '-0.453', '+0.449', '-0.443']\nL1 hid225 norm=3.36 top_in_dims [254, 373, 150, 25, 379, 282, 166, 273, 152, 181, 183, 128, 146, 319, 189] vals ['+0.718', '-0.558', '+0.513', '-0.495', '-0.491', '-0.486', '-0.479', '-0.462', '-0.444', '-0.418', '-0.398', '-0.383', '-0.372', '-0.365', '-0.360']\nL1 hid1053 norm=3.37 top_in_dims [373, 351, 368, 25, 150, 91, 110, 277, 146, 152, 379, 175, 181, 94, 360] vals ['-0.512', '+0.502', '-0.47